### 🏔️ Find Peak Element (LeetCode 162)

The peak is the point where the slope flips from rising to falling.

```python
class Solution:
    def findPeakElement(self, nums):
        left, right = -1, len(nums) - 1
        while right > left + 1:
            mid = (left + right) // 2
            if nums[mid] > nums[mid + 1]:
                right = mid     # descent starts → True zone
            else:
                left = mid      # still ascending
        return right
```

🧩 *Left = ascending zone (False), Right = peak or descending (True).*

